@host = http://localhost:8080

### Every source searched (trucks and boats): the truck list now reaches Claude
POST {{host}}/ask/augmented
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is a good truck to pull a Sportsman 232 boat?"
}

### Claude picks the sources: this one needs both
POST {{host}}/ask/routed
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is a good truck to pull a Sportsman 232 boat?"
}

### Claude picks the sources: trucks only (every chunk in "sources" is "trucks")
POST {{host}}/ask/routed
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How much can the Chevy Colorado tow?"
}

### Claude picks the sources: boats only
POST {{host}}/ask/routed
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the top speed of the Sportsman Open 232?"
}
